<section id="homeSection">
    <H1 id="homeHeader">Real-time NYC Rodent Data</H1>

    <p id="homepageDesc">
        Find restaurants, rodent hotspots, and real user reports in one place
        Make data-driven dining decisions with comprehensive rodent sighting data, health inspector reports, and community feedback from across New York City.
    </p>

    <p class="homeP">
        Make data-driven dining decisions with comprehensive rodent sighting data, health inspector reports, and community feedback from across New York City.
